{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"playImmediately"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"play()"},{"type":"text","text":" respects "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"automaticallyWaitsToMinimizeStalling"},{"type":"text","text":": the player keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rate at 0 while it re-evaluates whether playback can keep up, which costs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"~half a second of frozen frame even on an item whose buffer is already"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"full. That re-evaluation buys nothing on a pre-warmed handoff — the item"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"was buffered on the warm-up player precisely so it can start instantly —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the renderer uses this for warmed items only; cold loads keep "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"play()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and its stall protection."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Protocol surface since the live resume needs it too: that path corrects content’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"position repeatedly behind the ad, and the hold re-engages on every correction, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what costs half a second once costs a second per correction there."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"title":"playImmediately()","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"OptiViewAdsRuntime"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text